WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A small database fix: back up, save a checkpoint, then compare.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Alt+T focuses Tables. Type to find one, Enter opens it, and Space pins it.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Alt+B opens Instant Backup. Choose an absolute folder, create the backup, and wait for success.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Alt+W opens Change Profiler. Press N, name an anchor, select tasks and capture the baseline.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Alt+Q focuses SQL. Run each statement with Enter: update task 1, then insert task 4.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Scan your anchor with S. The result: one inserted row, one updated row, no deleted rows.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Open the report, select the updated row and press Enter for its full before-and-after values.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
An anchor shows observed differences. It is not an undo button or a record of who made the change.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Try the sample SQLite workflow. Get dbterm and the step-by-step guide on the site.
